According to law of chemical equilibrium,

K_p=\frac{\left(p_{\mathrm{NO}_2}\right)^2}{\left(p_{\mathrm{N}_2 \mathrm{O}_4}\right)}=\frac{\left(\frac{1}{1.5}\right)^2}{\left(\frac{1}{3}\right)}=1.33 \mathrm{~atm}

Apply, $\Delta G^{\circ}=-2.303 R T \log K_p$
\begin{aligned}
